<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CompDent started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CompDent started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jafray said it initiated coverage of CompDent Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said CompDent is one of the leading managed dental companies in the industry.</p>
<p>-- said CompDent has grown earnings greater than 20 percent annually fourteen of the fifteen years since 1981.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $25 to $27.</p>
<p>-- CompDent lost 3/8 to 21.</p>
</text>
